From a0c98ac6bb4ab15528f0711699709d539bccb4ef Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ZR build <zr@local>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 13:53:48 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 4/8] fix(zr): wait for tmt1.ini before colour suggest

Opening the print dialog from the Jobs page on a fresh load suggested
toolheads before tmt1.ini was read, falling back to the file's own tool
number even when that toolhead is empty. Share one load promise and
await it before suggesting.

Signed-off-by: ZR build <zr@local>
---
 src/components/widgets/zr/ZrPrintDialog.vue |  4 ++++
 src/components/widgets/zr/zrMixin.ts        | 12 ++++++++++--
 2 files changed, 14 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/components/widgets/zr/ZrPrintDialog.vue b/src/components/widgets/zr/ZrPrintDialog.vue
